    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Family of mains-powered, dual-range automatic weighing instruments designated the DACS-G-F015 Series, operating as automatic checkweighers (Category X). Stainless steel construction: fabricated floor-standing frame on adjustable feet carrying the in-feed, weigh and out-feed conveyors (conveyor type and size not restricted). Control cabinet behind the conveyors houses the electrical hardware; an enclosure below the weigh conveyor houses the ADC board and the dip-switches protecting the legally-relevant parameters. Jog-dial Remote Control Unit with LED display mounted in the upper part of the control cabinet. Photocells on the frame for pack detection; printer on the side of the control cabinet. Weighing device is a force balance electromagnetic cell located below the centre of the weigh conveyor."
